      "rationale": "Tupela tok “פה (long hia)” i kamap tripela taim, na “חצב (katim)” na “קבר (be)” i ripitim — pasin bilong tok i makim sevel bilong man; Tok Pisin i holim ripit bilong “long hia” tasol."
